      "id": 152611,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-08T13:16:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, MMFFCC is one of the more fiddly environments.</p><p>In all my playtesting I only played a few games that were Villains only, I did that to test difficulty and interaction, and really it works as intended, that mixing Villains with Vengeance makes for a better game than keeping them seperate.</p>",
